#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:9 Multiple Time
#: d29775b90d0a4bcaa3ed7dc919b4ce15
msgid "Multiple Time Intervals"
msgstr "多个时间区间"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 3f071b159a5f49b08de49bee86233c1a
#: Intervals.ipynb:11 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"You may want to make trading decisions on a different timeframe than your"
" underlying data source. For instance, you might choose to execute trades"
" on daily bars after confirming the trend on weekly or monthly bars. "
"**PyBroker v2** supports compressing backtest data into longer intervals "
"and making those compressed bars available to your strategy."
msgstr ""
"你可能希望以不同于底层数据源的时间框架来做出交易决策。例如，你可以选择在通过周线或月线确认趋势后，在日线上执行交易。**PyBroker v2**"
" 支持将回测数据压缩为更长的时间区间，并让这些压缩后的 K 线可供你的策略使用。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 4c1403d9cd6743309cc1d674c7cc8537
#: Intervals.ipynb:23 Multiple Time
msgid "Interval Types"
msgstr "区间类型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2294df584dca4b1a95a66809295fe01a
#: Intervals.ipynb:25 Multiple Time
msgid "You can define an interval using any of these three formats:"
msgstr "你可以使用以下三种格式中的任意一种来定义时间区间："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 7814e210f2b94d64be93331216002b18
#: Intervals.ipynb:27 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Every-n-bars** (``int`` greater than ``1``): Compresses every ``n`` "
"base bars into one bar. Using ``5`` on daily data produces one bar per "
"five trading days."
msgstr ""
"**每 n 根 K 线** （大于 ``1`` 的 ``int``）：将每 ``n`` 根基础 K 线压缩为一根 K 线。在日线数据上使用 "
"``5`` 会每五个交易日生成一根 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:28 Multiple Time
#: e99cfe524dba4b839caa742902fed888
msgid ""
"**Duration** (``str``): A fixed time span written as digits followed by a"
" single unit letter (``s``, ``m``, ``h``, or ``d``). Passing ``\"5m\"`` "
"compresses 1-minute bars into 5-minute bars."
msgstr ""
"**时长** （``str``）：以数字加单个单位字母（``s``、``m``、``h`` 或 ``d``）表示的固定时间跨度。传入 "
"``\"5m\"`` 会将 1 分钟 K 线压缩为 5 分钟 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:29 Multiple Time
#: b91fa19e34b74192bb9a85721506af3a
msgid ""
"**Calendar** (``str``): Aligns compressed bars to calendar boundaries "
"using one of the following options:"
msgstr "**日历** （``str``）：使用以下选项之一，将压缩后的 K 线对齐到日历边界："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 693ffc8ce2d448159a19747054778273
#: Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
msgid "Calendar String"
msgstr "日历字符串"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
#: b788e50af9314be0ab560fddae6980e0
msgid "Boundary Alignment"
msgstr "边界对齐"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
#: a2fdcc2c2e0c4ed18ddd6d8335df5071
msgid "``\"daily\"``"
msgstr "``\"daily\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
#: f4f2a418147042eeaf313a959a7dc0d7
msgid "Standard daily boundary."
msgstr "标准的每日边界。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 36d13730791d40818c0113883424bb51
#: Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"weekly\"``"
msgstr "``\"weekly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
#: eef53d83d019415cbade21d6e3deb730
msgid "Starts on Monday."
msgstr "从周一开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
#: f7bb3eee964e4b1690c8f9c8f155b880
msgid "``\"monthly\"``"
msgstr "``\"monthly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
#: c9a9b06635d84455b457e31658f7b99c
msgid "Starts on the 1st of the month."
msgstr "从每月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 629eb218139a4e219e59de7908257042
#: Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"quarterly\"``"
msgstr "``\"quarterly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
#: a5b7abf325e44bae876c1b2a38fe6dde
msgid "Begins in January, April, July, and October."
msgstr "从 1 月、4 月、7 月和 10 月开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
#: e43718a2ff284e4fa336acb6ea70543d
msgid "``\"yearly\"``"
msgstr "``\"yearly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
#: e318250e57694390aeb49c0355ea3019
msgid "Starts on January 1."
msgstr "从 1 月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:41 Multiple Time
#: d7707413fffd4858b72fccfab951fa4d
msgid ""
"Your chosen interval must always be longer than the bars being "
"compressed. For example, if you fetch daily bars from `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__,"
" then ``\"weekly\"`` and ``\"monthly\"`` are valid intervals. Attempting "
"to use ``\"daily\"`` or ``\"1h\"`` will raise a ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"你所选择的时间区间必须始终长于被压缩的 K 线。例如，如果你从 `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__"
" 获取日线数据，那么 ``\"weekly\"`` 和 ``\"monthly\"`` 都是有效的时间区间。尝试使用 ``\"daily\"`` "
"或 ``\"1h\"`` 将引发 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 491f635f7ed14dca9ea08f27666179a6
#: Intervals.ipynb:43 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Before using intervals in a strategy, let's build some intuition by "
"compressing bars directly. We will start by downloading daily data:"
msgstr "在策略中使用时间区间之前，让我们先通过直接压缩 K 线来建立一些直观认识。我们将从下载日线数据开始："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9d8a67ab74fd4df5a5dd6516aeb4b01d
#: Intervals.ipynb:313 Multiple Time
msgid "Compressing Bars"
msgstr "压缩 K 线"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 3fd54648bc3b426d85d9e37994f17c8b
#: Intervals.ipynb:315 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"The `compress_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__"
" function converts OHLCV data (either a `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"or `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__)"
" to a longer interval, returning the result as a new `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__"
" object. Every compressed bar is timestamped with the date of the last "
"base bar it contains."
msgstr ""
"`compress_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__"
" 函数可将 OHLCV 数据（可以是 `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ 或"
" `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__）转换为更长的时间区间，并以新的"
" `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__"
" 对象形式返回结果。每根压缩后的 K 线都以其所包含的最后一根基础 K 线的日期作为时间戳。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 39ba4b3c0d2a42e0905a4bc9abb37c27
#: Intervals.ipynb:318 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"When grouping base bars into a compressed bar, the data is aggregated as "
"follows:"
msgstr "在将基础 K 线分组为压缩 K 线时，数据将按以下方式聚合："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 31d050ef4e6d4ec0ad04c5fcff72439f
#: Intervals.ipynb:320 Multiple Time
msgid "**Open:** Taken from the first base bar."
msgstr "**开盘价：** 取自第一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 3ec25be6e44041c6bd9fe890193cb532
#: Intervals.ipynb:321 Multiple Time
msgid "**High / Low:** The highest high and lowest low."
msgstr "**最高价 / 最低价：** 取最高价中的最高值和最低价中的最低值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 20c3568ea4804f9ca4dd323966f70121
#: Intervals.ipynb:322 Multiple Time
msgid "**Close:** Taken from the last base bar."
msgstr "**收盘价：** 取自最后一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 1f439f215a4e4e4d88856774aa770ceb
#: Intervals.ipynb:323 Multiple Time
msgid "**Volume:** The sum of the volumes."
msgstr "**成交量：** 各成交量之和。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 99dcf8b62c244ac68d883669da25f09c
#: Intervals.ipynb:324 Multiple Time
msgid "**VWAP:** The volume-weighted average."
msgstr "**VWAP：** 成交量加权平均价。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 422243f4a8144d5c9123d60e6977d0ff
#: Intervals.ipynb:325 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Custom columns:** The last value in the period (e.g., `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__'s"
" ``adj_close``)."
msgstr ""
"**自定义列：** 取该周期内的最后一个值（例如 `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__"
" 的 ``adj_close``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 09aa5f4e12ff44878f2b0b73589255d6
#: Intervals.ipynb:327 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"You must also supply the ``base_timeframe`` parameter to declare the "
"spacing of your input bars (for example, ``\"1d\"`` for daily data)."
msgstr "你还必须提供 ``base_timeframe`` 参数，以声明输入 K 线的间隔（例如，日线数据对应 ``\"1d\"``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 8cd854d0fea84f55963169b137759859
#: Intervals.ipynb:329 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Let's compress AMD into calendar weeks and view the result as a `Pandas "
"DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"with `bars_to_df "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.bars_to_df>`__:"
msgstr ""
"让我们将 AMD 压缩为日历周，并使用 `bars_to_df "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.bars_to_df>`__"
" 将结果显示为 `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0cd67b3c0a4e48ee998912d77b176cdc
#: Intervals.ipynb:509 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Every-n-bars compression works the same way. In this example, every ``5``"
" daily bars become one bar:"
msgstr "每 n 根 K 线压缩的方式相同。在此示例中，每 ``5`` 根日线合并为一根 K 线："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:685 Multiple Time
#: cad302a59c2c42b78244fb7c42030314
msgid "A Multi-Timeframe Strategy"
msgstr "多时间框架策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2f7d63e18a92416baa81497c70fa8df4
#: Intervals.ipynb:687 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"To use higher timeframes in your backtest, pass the ``intervals`` "
"parameter to `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__."
" Your execution function can then access the compressed bars through "
"`ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__,"
" which returns a read-only `IntervalContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext>`__."
msgstr ""
"在构建回测时，你可以通过向 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 传递 ``intervals`` 参数来使用更高的时间框架。随后，你的执行函数便可通过 `ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" 访问这些压缩后的 K 线，该方法会返回一个只读的 `IntervalContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext>`__。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2556433aa1b84cf39b055bc99ae2f707
#: Intervals.ipynb:690 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Using the ``intervals`` parameter provides compressed bars only. "
"Indicators and models are never computed on these intervals unless you "
"bind them explicitly, as shown later in this notebook."
msgstr "使用 ``intervals`` 参数仅提供压缩后的 K 线。除非像本文档后续内容那样显式绑定，否则指标和模型永远不会在这些区间上计算。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 17e3b4f641f244ebac8a0faa7fee1f5b
#: Intervals.ipynb:692 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"To prevent look-ahead bias, `ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" only ever exposes *completed* bars. For example, the week or month that "
"is currently forming is never visible, ensuring that future data cannot "
"leak into your daily trading decisions."
msgstr ""
"为防止前视偏差，`ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" 只会公开 *已完成* 的 K 线。例如，当前正在形成的这一周或这一月永远不可见，从而确保未来数据不会泄漏到你的每日交易决策中。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:694 Multiple Time
#: f1ca65548f09467ca30a192e709784e8
msgid ""
"In the following strategy, we will execute trades on daily bars while "
"using longer intervals to generate different trading signals:"
msgstr "在下面的策略中，我们将在日线上执行交易，同时使用更长的时间区间来生成不同的交易信号："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:696 Multiple Time
#: d42a32483a5b481e864428f523ee800a
msgid ""
"**Monthly (Regime):** Only enter when the last completed monthly close is"
" higher than the close from three months ago."
msgstr "**月线（市场状态）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的月线收盘价高于三个月前的收盘价时才建仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 6c3ddb4fd280414ca21038d275dbe8d3
#: Intervals.ipynb:697 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Weekly (Trend):** Only enter when the last completed weekly close is "
"higher than the close from ten weeks ago, and exit when it falls below."
msgstr "**周线（趋势）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的周线收盘价高于十周前的收盘价时才建仓，跌破时平仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 5cf7db92da8e4e87a6002017dc067d50
#: Intervals.ipynb:698 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Daily (Timing):** Enter on the first daily close above the last "
"completed weekly close."
msgstr "**日线（择时）：** 在首根日线收盘价高于最后一根已完成的周线收盘价时建仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1056 Multiple Time
#: e239ac7b1b7e454d90754d44833c1ede
msgid "Binding an Indicator to an Interval"
msgstr "将指标绑定到区间"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1058 Multiple Time
#: b857426c41bd4f68b7ca6bd3de4c9a94
msgid ""
"To compute an indicator on compressed bars, bind it to one or more "
"intervals with `Indicator.intervals(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__."
msgstr ""
"要在压缩 K 线上计算指标，请使用 `Indicator.intervals(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__"
" 将其绑定到一个或多个区间。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 1b52aa9c6c9d4a2891c244cd5cb7c5e9
#: Intervals.ipynb:1060 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"The example below updates the weekly trend rule to compare the weekly "
"close against a 10-bar SMA calculated from the weekly bars:"
msgstr "下面的示例更新了周线趋势规则，将周线收盘价与基于周线计算的 10 根 K 线 SMA 进行比较："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 62d74015c95343c294728dddcf1233b4
#: Intervals.ipynb:1108 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** automatically combines bound intervals with those in the "
"execution's ``intervals`` parameter. Here, the ``\"weekly\"`` interval is"
" made accessible via `ctx.interval(\"weekly\") "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" and the ``intervals`` parameter only needs to specify ``\"monthly\"`` "
"for the raw monthly bars."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 会自动将已绑定的区间与执行函数的 ``intervals`` 参数取并集，因此示例中的 ``\"weekly\"`` "
"区间可通过 `ctx.interval(\"weekly\") "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" 访问。此时 ``intervals`` 参数只需指定 ``\"monthly\"``，用于提供原始的月线数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1110 Multiple Time
#: f064e5166e7c4ab782a966d9e68ede1c
msgid ""
"Note that the binding will override also computing the indicator on the "
"base timeframe of the data source. To also compute the indicator on the "
"base timeframe of the data source, pass ``\"base\"`` to "
"`Indicator.intervals() "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，绑定会覆盖在数据源基础时间框架上计算该指标的行为。若要同时在数据源的基础时间框架上计算该指标，需向 "
"`Indicator.intervals() "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals>`__"
" 传入 ``\"base\"``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1501 Multiple Time
#: a81089fc14ab4315945d5aaf933ce32f
msgid "Training a Model on an Interval"
msgstr "在区间上训练模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:1503 Multiple Time
#: a96fdc9643724e10865f923ee5bb918c
msgid ""
"You can bind models in the same way with `ModelSource.intervals(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals>`__."
" **PyBroker** will then train models for each interval using the "
"interval's compressed bars and any registered indicators. You can then "
"access the per-interval predictions by calling the `preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds>`__"
" method on that interval's context."
msgstr ""
"你可以用相同的方式，通过 `ModelSource.intervals(...) "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals>`__"
" 绑定模型。**PyBroker** 接着会使用该区间的压缩 K 线以及任何已注册的指标，为每个区间训练模型。随后，你可以在该区间的上下文上调用 "
"`preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds>`__"
" 方法来获取该区间的预测结果。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 72ec78e74a9b46e0ba2449beb9324d25
#: Intervals.ipynb:1506 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"This example trains a `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" model to predict the next weekly return from the weekly close:"
msgstr ""
"本示例训练一个 `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" 模型，根据周线收盘价预测下一周的收益率："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 63e90d1a7a7943e68d0dfe14a5ff7b19
#: Intervals.ipynb:1558 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"During `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__,"
" the ``lookahead`` between an interval model's train and test data is "
"enforced using the compressed bar units in order to prevent future "
"leakage."
msgstr ""
"在 `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
